  <metadata>
    <name>Ten unconnected bridleway segments (test fixture)</name>
    <desc>Ten separate stretches of bridleway spread across Oxfordshire, with no
      connection between them. Geometry traced from OpenStreetMap ways tagged
      highway=bridleway. Not a rideable route - a fixture for checking how the
      site renders a track made of disjoint segments. No elevation data.</desc>
    <copyright author="OpenStreetMap contributors"><license>https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/</license></copyright>
    <time>2026-09-13T21:16:23Z</time>
  </metadata>
